---
import TraitCard from '@components/ui/TraitCard.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="py-20 px-8 md:px-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="animate-on-scroll mb-10">
      <p class="text-brand text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">About</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-gray-900">Who Am I?</h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-brand mt-4"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="animate-on-scroll space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-2xl">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm <strong class="text-gray-800">Antonio</strong> — a Senior Solutions Engineer with
        4+ years in pre-sales for cloud broadcast and FAST infrastructure. I currently support
        Tier 1 sports and media accounts across North America at{' '}
        <em>Amagi</em>, working with CTO, VP Engineering, and Head of Distribution stakeholders
        at some of the most recognized names in U.S. sports and media.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before moving into pre-sales, I spent over 10 years on the engineering side — starting as
        a software build engineer at IBM, then growing through streaming technical support, team
        lead, and support management at Ooyala, before transitioning to Sales Engineering at
        Brightcove and Bitmovin.
      </p>
      <p>
        That hands-on engineering foundation is what I bring to every pre-sales engagement. I can
        map a customer's multi-system broadcast environment end-to-end, design a cloud playout or
        FAST migration architecture, and translate it into a proposal that speaks to both
        engineering stakeholders and C-suite decision-makers.
      </p>
      <p>
        I authored the Technical Discovery framework now adopted as the canonical model across
        Amagi's global SE organization — covering channel architecture mapping, programming matrix
        analysis, contribution path design, and scheduling dependency modeling.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <TraitCard title="Pre-Sales Strategy" accentClass="border-brand" icon="bulb" />
      <TraitCard title="Streaming Domain" accentClass="border-brand-red" icon="globe" />
      <TraitCard title="Technical Architecture" accentClass="border-brand-yellow" icon="code" />
      <TraitCard title="Discovery Design" accentClass="border-brand-purple" icon="heart" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
